{"lang":"hi","dir":"ltr","title":"Romack Home Maintenance Services (Rowmack Inc.) | वाकाविल, CA में हैंडीमैन","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">मुख्य सामग्री पर जाएँ</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">R</span><span>Romack Home Maintenance Services</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">हमारे बारे में</a><a href=\"#services\">सेवाएँ</a><a href=\"#faq\">सवाल-जवाब</a><a href=\"#gallery\">तस्वीरें</a><a href=\"#reviews\">रिव्यू</a><a href=\"#visit\">समय और पता</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"भाषा\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\">中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\" selected>हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17073178126\">कॉल करें</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/cedar-steps.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">हैंडीमैन · वाकाविल, CA · Rowmack Inc.</p>\n    <h1>Romack Home Maintenance Services</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">वो हैंडीमैन जो कर सकता है। Bob Mackert आपके घर की मरम्मत, फ़िटिंग और बढ़ईगीरी में 25+ साल का अनुभव लाते हैं, एक बार में एक प्रोजेक्ट।</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.9 · Google पर 39 रिव्यू<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17073178126\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> Bob को कॉल या टेक्स्ट करें</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Romack%20Home%20Maintenance%20Services%2C%20Vacaville%2C%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> नक्शा</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">39 रिव्यू से 4.9★</a></li><li>25+ साल का अनुभव</li><li>अक्सर उसी दिन जवाब</li><li>हर काम के बाद सफ़ाई</li><li>क्रेडिट कार्ड स्वीकार</li><li>शनिवार खुला</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">Bob से मिलिए</p><h2>एक बार में एक प्रोजेक्ट।</h2><p>Romack Home Maintenance Services, जिसे Rowmack Inc. भी कहते हैं, मैं हूँ, वाकाविल का हैंडीमैन Robert &quot;Bob&quot; Mackert। मेरे पास 25 साल से ज़्यादा का अनुभव है, और अगर आपका प्रोजेक्ट लकड़ी और/या घरों से जुड़ा है, तो मेरे हुनर की सूची लंबी है, साधारण से लेकर कस्टम तक।</p><p>मैं जल्दी जवाब देता हूँ, अक्सर उसी दिन, समय पर पहुँचता हूँ, उचित दाम लेता हूँ और काम के बाद सफ़ाई करता हूँ। बहुत से ग्राहक घर के एक के बाद एक प्रोजेक्ट के लिए मुझे फिर से बुलाते हैं।</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.9★</b><span>39 रिव्यू</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>25+ साल</b><span>अनुभव</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>सोम–शनि</b><span>6 दिन खुला</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/entry-steps.jpg\" alt=\"रेलिंग वाली लकड़ी की सीढ़ियाँ\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">सेवाएँ</p><h2>Bob क्या करते हैं</h2></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>शीटरॉक और टेक्सचरिंग</h3></div><p>शीटरॉक की मरम्मत और छत की टेक्सचरिंग।</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>दरवाज़े लगाना और मरम्मत</h3></div><p>अंदर के, बाहर के और गैराज के साइड दरवाज़े लगाना, ठीक करना और मरम्मत।</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>फ़र्श लगाना और मरम्मत</h3></div><p>लैमिनेट फ़र्श और बेसबोर्ड।</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>फ़र्नीचर असेंबली</h3></div><p>डेस्क और भी बहुत कुछ, फटाफट जोड़ा हुआ।</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>बढ़ईगीरी</h3></div><p>लकड़ी के प्रोजेक्ट, साधारण से कस्टम तक।</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>सड़ी लकड़ी हटाना और बदलना</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>कॉकिंग</h3></div></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">08</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>प्लंबिंग की मरम्मत</h3></div><p>शावर हेड और दूसरे फ़िक्स्चर बदलना।</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">09</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>फ़िक्स्चर और उपकरण लगाना</h3></div><p>छत के पंखे और चूल्हे के ऊपर लगने वाले माइक्रोवेव, पुराने उपकरण उठाकर ले जाता हूँ।</p></article></div><p class=\"note\">मैं दाम ऑनलाइन नहीं डालता, लेकिन मेरे दाम उचित और वाजिब हैं। अपने प्रोजेक्ट पर बात करने के लिए (707) 317-8126 पर कॉल या टेक्स्ट करें।</p></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">जानने लायक</p><h2>जानने लायक बातें</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>क्रेडिट कार्ड स्वीकार</b></li><li><b>जल्दी जवाब</b><span>अक्सर उसी दिन, कभी-कभी एक घंटे के अंदर</span></li><li><b>काम की जगह साफ़</b><span>मैं हर काम के बाद सफ़ाई करता हूँ</span></li><li><b>पुराने उपकरण उठाकर ले जाता हूँ</b></li><li><b>शनिवार खुला</b><span>सुबह 9–दोपहर 3</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">गैलरी</p><h2>हाल के प्रोजेक्ट</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/tile-shower.jpg\" alt=\"टाइल वाली शावर की दीवार\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fireplace-wall.jpg\" alt=\"पत्थर की फ़ायरप्लेस वाली दीवार\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/deck-rebuild.jpg\" alt=\"बन रहा लकड़ी का डेक\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/treehouse-deck.jpg\" alt=\"ऊँचा लकड़ी का डेक\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/shed.jpg\" alt=\"सामान रखने का शेड\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/garden-bench.jpg\" alt=\"बगीचे की लकड़ी की बेंच\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/laminate-floor.jpg\" alt=\"गलियारे में लकड़ी जैसा फ़र्श\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/entry-steps.jpg\" alt=\"लकड़ी की सीढ़ियाँ\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"press\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">मालिक</p><h2>Bob की ज़ुबानी</h2></div><div class=\"press\"><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“Handyman services, With the one project at a time attitude. laminate floor installation, Doors installed, With over 25 yrs experience, If your project involves wood and/or houses, My list of skills goes on, From simple to custom, You get what you want with Rowmack .inc Simply put, The handyman that can.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Robert Mackert, owner</b> · In Bob&#39;s words</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">रिव्यू</p><h2>ग्राहक क्या कहते हैं</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 39 रिव्यू</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google पर और रिव्यू पढ़ें →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.5</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 12 रिव्यू</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/rowmack-vacaville-3#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp पर और रिव्यू पढ़ें →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“He is the best handyman I’ve ever hired. Very professional and kind. We are very satisfied.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jan 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I am absolutely thrilled to write a review for Robert, who recently installed a ceiling fan in my home. From start to finish, the experience was nothing short of exceptional. Robert is the epitome of professionalism. He arrived precisely on time, which I greatly appreciate, and immediately got to work. Beyond his punctuality, his demeanor was incredibly pleasant, and he even had a great sense of humor that made the whole process enjoyable. What truly set Robert apart was his keen eye and observant nature. He noticed a small detail about the wiring that could have caused an issue down the line…”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jul 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“My husband text Bob, today Sunday March 2, 2025 to replace a shower head in one of our bathrooms. Bob, responded immediately and said that he’d be out today, he arrived within the hour and replaced the shower head within a few minutes. He’s quick, reasonably priced and more importantly, he cleans up behind himself. We use Bob on a regular basis for various repairs around the house.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Mar 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Bob is very helpful, very affordable and upfront. I called and he showed up within an hour and a half. I had one project that I called him out for, but after having him look at the main project, I intend on using his services for all of my other projects that need to be taken care of.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“I called ROWMACK today and spoke with Robert Mackert. I will be working from home starting tomorrow and my desk was still in the box!!! Bob came to my house and within an hour my desk was complete. He is also very nice. So if you need someone to put your furniture together, please call my new handy man at ROWMACK INC! Trust me, you will be glad you did!!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/vacaville/rowmack-inc-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · Jan 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Robert responded the same day. He arrived on time and went to work. Completed task in a reasonable time and charged a fair fee for a difficult job. Cleaned up his work area. I am very pleased and would not hesitate to hire him again.”</blockquote><figcaption>— BestProsInTown reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.bestprosintown.com/ca/vacaville/rowmack-inc-/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BestProsInTown</a> · Sep 2023</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Bob is an excellent worker. Shows up when he says he will and makes sure whatever he is working on is repaired correctly. We’ve had three different people work on our door, but they never fixed it. Bob put in the time to make sure it was done correctly. He is reasonable in his pricing and very kind. We will definitely be using his services in the future!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2022</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Bob of Rowmack Inc Handyman Services did a side garage door install. He knew exactly what was required to start and finish the project in a timely matter. His professional talent produced outstanding results. I am more than pleased with his work. I have already ask Bob to schedule me in for another install in the kitchen. Highly Recommended”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Mar 2022</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Such great service received today. I found Bob&#39;s information while searching for someone to install my over the range microwave. I reached out to Bob and he was very responsive and was able to get me all set up this morning. Bob even recommended an earlier time. I really can say what quality work and Bob hauled away the old appliance as well. I will recommend Bob to anyone and even make use of him again for other things needed to be done in my house. If I could have given 10 stars I would.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2021</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Bob knows his stuff! He did an awesome job installing our lament flooring and baseboards, he also was so fast at texturing my ceilings, and did some great electrical work for us. I love how flexible he is with our schedule and overall really fun to work with, I would highly recommend for any construction job!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Romack%20Home%20maintenance%20services%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Apr 2018</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">सवाल-जवाब</p><h2>आपके सवालों के जवाब</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>क्या Romack और Rowmack Inc. एक ही हैं?</summary><p>हाँ, वो मैं ही हूँ। मैं Robert &quot;Bob&quot; Mackert हूँ, और मेरा कारोबार Romack Home Maintenance Services और Rowmack Inc. दोनों नामों से जाना जाता है।</p></details><details><summary>आप किस तरह के काम लेते हैं?</summary><p>शीटरॉक की मरम्मत और टेक्सचरिंग, दरवाज़े, लैमिनेट फ़र्श और बेसबोर्ड, फ़र्नीचर असेंबली, बढ़ईगीरी, सड़ी लकड़ी की मरम्मत, कॉकिंग, प्लंबिंग फ़िक्स्चर बदलना, छत के पंखे और उपकरण लगाना। अगर काम लकड़ी और/या घरों से जुड़ा है, तो पूछ लीजिए।</p></details><details><summary>आप कितनी जल्दी आ सकते हैं?</summary><p>अक्सर जल्दी। मैं अक्सर उसी दिन जवाब दे देता हूँ, कभी-कभी एक या डेढ़ घंटे में।</p></details><details><summary>कितना ख़र्च आएगा?</summary><p>मैं दाम ऑनलाइन नहीं डालता, लेकिन मेरे दाम उचित, किफ़ायती और पहले से साफ़ होते हैं। अपना प्रोजेक्ट बताने के लिए मुझे (707) 317-8126 पर कॉल या टेक्स्ट करें।</p></details><details><summary>आपके काम का समय क्या है?</summary><p>मैं सोमवार–शुक्रवार सुबह 7–शाम 6 और शनिवार सुबह 9–दोपहर 3 काम करता हूँ। रविवार बंद।</p></details><details><summary>क्या आप क्रेडिट कार्ड लेते हैं?</summary><p>हाँ, मैं क्रेडिट कार्ड लेता हूँ।</p></details><details><summary>आपके पास कितना अनुभव है?</summary><p>मेरे पास 25 साल से ज़्यादा का अनुभव है।</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">सेवा क्षेत्र</p>\n      <h2>समय और सेवा क्षेत्र</h2>\n      <address>Vacaville, CA में सेवा<br>Vacaville, CA 95687 में स्थित</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17073178126\">(707) 317-8126</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>सोमवार</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>मंगलवार</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>बुधवार</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>गुरुवार</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>शुक्रवार</td><td>7 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>शनिवार</td><td>9 AM – 3 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>रविवार</td><td>बंद</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">आने का समय तय करने के लिए कॉल या टेक्स्ट करें।</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Romack+Home+maintenance+services/@38.3342357,-121.9779348,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d4c259ea703:0x2839b9bca65479b8!8m2!3d38.3342357!4d-121.9779348!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Google</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/row